Description: Spaced Linux MATE themes, icons, and boot artwork
 Supplies the selectable Spaced GTK/Metacity themes, icon themes including
 the Brisk start-here mark, the theme registry, and the GRUB theme.
 Upgrading this package refreshes the compiled icon caches.
